              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние:  <span data-inline-latex=\"(2\\sin x-1)(\\sqrt{-\\cos x}+1)=0\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{3\\pi}{2};3\\pi]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:42:36.077238+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{17\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:42:36.077238+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Левая часть урав­не­ния имеет смысл при  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\cos x\\ge 0\"></span>. Вы­ра­же­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{-\\cos x}+1\"></span> по­ло­жи­тель­но при всех до­пу­сти­мых зна­че­ни­ях  <i>x</i>.<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"569f0f52-ac60-41b4-9457-56a8d479267e\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>Зна­чит, </p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(2\\sin x-1)(\\sqrt{-\\cos x}+1)=0\\iff \\begin{cases}-\\cos x\\ge 0\\\\2\\sin x-1=0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\begin{cases}\\cos x\\le 0\\\\\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff x=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</span></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{3\\pi}{2};3\\pi]\"></span> ,  отберём с по­мо­щью еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. По­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{17\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
