              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T16:51:39.739995+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"a)\"><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"265097ec-7a58-4f29-834d-c46f70555265\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>Левая часть урав­не­ния имеет смысл при <span data-inline-latex=\"\\ctg x\\le 0\"></span>. Вы­ра­же­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{-2\\ctg x}\"></span>  по­ло­жи­тель­но при всех до­пу­сти­мых <span data-inline-latex=\"x\"></span>. Зна­чит, <center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}\\sin 2x-\\sin x=0,\\\\\\operatorname{ctg}x\\le 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\sin x(2\\cos x-1)=0,\\\\\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\le 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\sin x&amp;=0,\\\\\\cos x&amp;=\\dfrac{1}{2},\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\le 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\cos x=\\dfrac{1}{2},\\\\\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}\\le 0\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow x=-\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}+2\\pi k,\\ k\\in\\mathbb{Z}.\"></span></p><p></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">При по­мо­щи три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти отберём корни урав­не­ния, ле­жа­щие на от­рез­ке  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\frac{\\pi}{2};3\\pi]\"></span> .  По­лу­чим число  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
